  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-2TO5-R7-030$qb$, $qb$A5-02$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A junior teammate asks for the answer before trying a problem themselves. The aim is to build independent reasoning and confidence. What is the best response?$qb$, $qb$Ask them to explain what they know and guide them toward the next step$qb$, $qb$Give them a hint and ask them to try first$qb$, $qb$Give the answer so they can learn from it$qb$, $qb$Tell them to solve it alone$qb$, $qb$Take over the problem$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
