  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-2TO5-R7-032$qb$, $qb$A5-04$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your team receives a request that is useful but does not support the current quarter's main outcome. The request competes with work already tied to an agreed objective. What is the best response?$qb$, $qb$Assess its value against committed priorities and negotiate timing if it would distract from the main outcome$qb$, $qb$Explain current priorities and offer a later time$qb$, $qb$Accept it because it is useful$qb$, $qb$Add it to the team's workload without changing anything$qb$, $qb$Drop a priority task without discussion$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
