  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-2TO5-R8-033$qb$, $qb$A5-03$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A change in your work will delay another team's activity by one day. The other team needs enough notice to adjust its own plan. What should you do?$qb$, $qb$Tell the affected team early, explain the impact, and agree the next step$qb$, $qb$Tell them as soon as the new date is fully confirmed$qb$, $qb$Update your manager and let them inform the other team$qb$, $qb$Wait until the other team asks about the delay$qb$, $qb$Say nothing because the delay is only one day$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
