  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-5TO10-R2-046$qb$, $qb$A5-05$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your team and another team both collect the same customer data separately. Both teams achieve their own targets while customers experience worsening delay at the boundary. What is the best improvement?$qb$, $qb$Agree a shared source, ownership, and update process so the data is collected once$qb$, $qb$Compare the two collections and decide which can become the main source$qb$, $qb$Ask the other team to stop collecting the data$qb$, $qb$Keep both collections and reconcile differences$qb$, $qb$Ignore the duplication because each team has its own process$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
